== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that drops a [[Heart]], [[coin]], {{e|Bomb}}, or {{e|Key}} (or any of their variations) alternatively every 5 or 6 [[rooms]].

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars.
** {{dlc|nr+}} Mystery Sack has 6th priority.
** {{dlc|r+}} Mystery Sack has 8th priority.
* Can spawn troll bombs.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: The familiar drops pickups alternatingly every 4 or 5 rooms.

