== Trivia ==
* Before patch 1.04, this item did not drop any items or do anything at all. Why it did not work remains a mystery.
* This item is the only "bag" item ({{I|Sack of Pennies}}, {{I|Rune Bag}}, {{I|Bomb Bag}}, and {{I|Sack of Sacks}}), that isn't a counterpart to other existing bag items, rather being a combination of some.

